---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import ContactInfo from "../components/ContactInfo.astro";
import { buildImageUrl, getMediaFolder } from "../lib/media";

const profile = getMediaFolder("system").find(
  (asset) => asset.publicId === "rehders_photos_mjmpdc",
);
---

<Layout
  title="Josh Rehders — Photographer and Videographer"
  description="Josh Rehders is a photographer and videographer based in New York City, with a focus on capturing electronic music events."
>

  <main>  
    <Header />
      <div class="about-container">
        <div class="contact-info-mobile">
          <ContactInfo />
        </div>
        <div class="about-text">
          <div>
            <p style="font-size: 25px;">Josh Rehders is an award winning photographer and videographer in New York City and beyond.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>He spent four years living in Nashville, where he served as the Creative Media Director at <a href="https://lightsonthelawn.org" target="_blank">Lights on the Lawn</a>, Nashville's flagship charity concert, and as the Photography Director at the <a href="https://vanderbilthustler.com" target="_blank">Vanderbilt Hustler</a>, the student newspaper of his alma mater. During that time he covered a variety of shows for his outlet, and collaborated with numerous artists during their stops in Nashville. In addition to his own creative work, he has led teams that have won numerous awards for their coverage packages during his time in Nashville.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>After graduating and moving to NYC, Josh has continued his creative multimedia services, collaborating with artists visitng NYC to document their shows, as well as traveling to capture unforgettable experiences nationwide. During the day, he works at Microsoft in the city, developing AI products to further productivity and collaboration in enterprise settings.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>Josh's work has been recognized by artists, outlets, and award organizations for its excellence in capturing and encapsulating moments in time. Artists at every level have used his photographs and video for physical and digital promotional materials, and of course for social media posts. News outlets such as <a href="https://apnews.com/article/covid-politics-health-soccer-sports-3ea64a2321a9ce1eabc8d757140c0988" target="_blank">the Associated Press</a>, <a href="https://time.com/6975991/campus-protests-student-photojournalists-cover-story/" target="_blank">TIME Magazine</a>, and <a href="https://www.goodmorningamerica.com/living/video/elite-athlete-opens-pressure-best-84052634" target="_blank">NBC</a> have published his content in print, online, and in TV segments.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>Josh is available for hire for media coverage of concerts, festivals, and tours, as well as sports and other creative projects. Reach out via phone or email and he will be in touch to discuss.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar">
          <div class="contact-info-desktop">
            <ContactInfo />
          </div>
          <div class="profpic">
            {profile && <img src={buildImageUrl(profile.key, "w-960")} alt="Josh Rehders" />}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </main>

</Layout>
